  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n52 × 52 - 48 × 48\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(A² - B²) = (A + B) (A - B)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 52 × 52 - 48 × 48\n\n⇒ (52)² - (48)²\n\n⇒ (52 + 48) (52 - 48)\n\n⇒ 100 × 4 = 400\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 400.**",
